		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Activer pg_stat_statments]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=27640#p27640"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Je veux activer l&#039;extension pg_stat_statments. J&#039;ai dajà installé postgresql-contrib 9.3.4.<br />Mais lors de redémarrage de postgresl j&#039;ai l&#039;erreur ci-dessous. </p><p>$ /usr/local/pgsql/bin/pg_ctl -D /usr/local/pgsql/postgresdb/ start<br />server starting<br />FATAL:&#160; could not access file &quot;pg_stat_statements&quot;: No such file or directory</p><p>Pourriez-vous m&#039;aider SVP</p>]]></content>
